  <name>Just Keep Chasing</name>
  <summary>A wave-based 2D shooter with roguelite elements</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Play as a nanobot fighting viruses, bacteria, and other pathogens inside a human body. Survive endless waves for 5 minutes to win.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Wave-based combat with 30+ enemy types</li>
      <li>10+ weapons including shotguns, sniper rifles, and rocket launchers</li>
      <li>Power-ups: slow time, heal, screen blast, invincibility</li>
      <li>Augment system for upgrading between waves</li>
      <li>Ally support (White Blood Cell companion)</li>
      <li>30+ language localizations</li>
      <li>Touch controls for mobile devices</li>
      <li>Achievement tracking</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Controls: WASD or arrow keys to move, Space to switch weapons, 1-4 for power-ups.</p>
  </description>
